  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款由 Serilum 制作的模组。倾心打造。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>治疗篝火会在篝火周围创建一个区域，玩家和/或被动生物在该区域内会在可配置半径内获得生命恢复效果。只要模组中的被动实体<em>不</em>被归类为\"<em>EntityClassification.Monster</em>\"，它们也会得到治疗。当实体身上的剩余恢复效果持续时间过半，并且靠近篝火时，效果时长会刷新。<br><br></span><strong><span>1.16 版本的灵魂篝火同样兼容！此功能可配置。</span></strong><br>您可能还对 <span><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/no-hostiles-around-campfire\">篝火旁无敌对生物</a></strong></span>感兴趣。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective 库\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于《原版体验》整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的 RPG 合集包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>checkForCampfireDelayInTicks</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 40，最小值 1，最大值 1200<br>模组检测玩家周围篝火的频率，以游戏刻为单位。1秒=20刻，因此默认每2秒检测一次。<br><br><span><strong>healingRadius&nbsp;</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 16，最小值 1，最大值 64<br>篝火周围玩家获得生命恢复效果的范围半径，以方块为单位。<br><br><span><strong>effectDurationSeconds</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 60，最小值 1，最大值 600<br>篝火施加的生命恢复效果的持续时间，以秒为单位。<br><br><span><strong>regenerationLevel</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 1，最小值 1，最大值 50<br>篝火施加的生命恢复效果的等级，默认等级为1。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>healPassiveMobs&nbsp;</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>启用后，篝火会治疗周围半径相当于边界框一半宽度的区域内的被动生物。<br><br><span><strong>hideEffectParticles&nbsp;</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>启用后，会隐藏篝火周围生命恢复效果产生的粒子。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>campfireMustBeLit</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>启用后，篝火方块必须被点燃才有效果。<br><br><span><strong>campfireMustBeSignalling</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 false<br>启用后，篝火方块必须处于信号触发状态才有效果。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><em>仅限 1.16+ 版本的配置选项：</em></span><br><br><span><strong>enableEffectForNormalCampfires</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>启用后，模组将对普通篝火生效。<br><br><span><strong>enableEffectForSoulCampfires</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>启用后，模组将对灵魂篝火生效。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>篝火周围的生命恢复效果：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/healing-campfire/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模组，前提是下载链接仍托管于 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台内。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 网站包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或任何其他事宜，请访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
